" screen.'=>'如果启用，非编辑者需要通过“权限”屏幕授予编辑访问权限。','If enabled, a Visibility Status dropdown will appear in Quick Edit for easy status assignment.'=>'如果启用，快速编辑中将出现可见性状态下拉菜单，以便于状态分配。','If enabled, this will add Visibility Statuses support to the PublishPress Status plugin.'=>'如果启用，这将为 PublishPress Status 插件添加可见性状态支持。','Default Capabilities'=>'默认能力','Revision'=>'修订','Same as PARENT STATUS (%s)'=>'与父状态相同 (%s)','Same as %s status'=>'与 %s 状态相同','(Same as %s)'=>'(与 %s 相同)','Same as %s'=>'与 %s 相同','Search roles...'=>'搜索角色...','restriction_attributeSub%1$s %2$s: '=>'子%1$s %2$s: ']];